The '''Treasure Hunter''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Archaeological Site}} that offers the player quests to find treasure chests located throughout the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}. The player must pay a certain amount of {{Coins}} to start a quest, with the treasure rewards increasing in value based on the amount of {{coins}} paid.

== Treasure ==
After paying a certain amount of {{c}}, the player will receive a hint as to the location of the treasure. Finding the treasure will reward the player with an item.
